### LOGIN
POST http://localhost:3300/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### REFRESH TOKEN
POST http://localhost:3300/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refresh_token": "COLOCA_AQUI_EL_REFRESH_TOKEN"
}

### LOGOUT
POST http://localhost:3300/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer COLOCA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN
